## Why the earlier log said admission=null

`item3-endpoint-assertions.log` was captured against the older m4 runtime bundle. That bundle
has no patch 0023, so the Ticket model has no `admission` field and the snapshot necessarily
returned null. The same HTTP surface is observable on the admission-aware build.

## The interface that exposes the actual fence

GET /bridge/v1/tickets/:id returns `admission: {leaseId, fencingToken}` when the runtime
accepted one for the Ticket. `ticket.state_changed` events carry the same values as
`leaseId`/`fencingToken`. This is the runtime's accepted value, not a caller echo.

