The test first asserts before.admission is non-null (no `?? 'stale-lease'` fallback), then
asserts paused.stoppedAt and paused.evidence (including lingeringPids=[]), the new
assignment is running and differs from the pre-pause assignment, the snapshot admission
equals the submitted lease/fence, and a second pause followed by a resume with the old
admission returns HTTP 409 with code `admissionStale` while the snapshot keeps the new
admission and assignment. Final green run:
